#. フン…それがどうした。
#. 俺の言ってる事に何か間違いがあるか？
msgctxt "0001 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Hmph. What, you think there's some mistake lurking in\n"
"what I said?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ちょっと苗木、脅かさないでよ！
#. 何か変な事言ったかと思っちゃったじゃん！
msgctxt "0003 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"C'mon Makoto, don't scare me like that! Makes me think\n"
"something weird is going on!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ジェノサイダー翔が…事件に関係してる根拠…
#. 確か、それって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The evidence that shows Genocide Jack is related to\n"
"the case... It has to be...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>図書倉庫で十神クンから見せてもらった例の物…
#. あれを見れば、誰だって思うはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The thing Byakuya showed me in the archive... One look\n"
"at that and anyone would be convinced.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今回の事件がジェノサイダー翔の仕業だって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It shows that this was the work of Genocide Jack...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
